Z||000002||stimpy||10-29-2000||08:29 AM||||I suggest Mother's California Gold clay bar system. It will do a great job of pulling off the dead paint and be much easier to clean up then wax or polish.  It ahould be available at your local auto parts store for around $13, but will be enough product to do about 3 entire Fieros (not just the plenums, I mean.)||||reg||14
